From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t3code-customize <t3code-customize@localhost>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:21:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Local: serve usage limits as a JSON feed for desktop
 widgets

GET /api/usage-limits returns every enabled subscription's session and
weekly windows from the provider snapshots the server already holds, so a
widget such as Dockset can poll it. Requests need the bearer token kept in
<stateDir>/usage-limits-api-token, created on first start.
